{
  "title": "Onboarding Rewrite Review",
  "aspectRatio": "16:9",
  "slides": [
    {
      "id": "slide-1",
      "layout": "blank",
      "notes": "Set the stage: this is an internal review, not a customer-facing deck. Land on the activation problem fast.",
      "content": "<div class=\"fmd-slide\" style=\"padding: 64px 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; background-color: #0a0a0a; color: #faf9f5;\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; max-width: 720px;\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9a9997;\">Q3 Planning &middot; Product</div><h1 style=\"font-size: 56px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0; color: #faf9f5;\">Rebuilding the onboarding path for <span style=\"color:#01c8f1\">faster activation</span></h1><p style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.35; color: #9a9997; margin: 0; max-width: 620px;\">A look at what shipped last quarter, what slipped, and where the next ninety days should go.</p></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\"><div style=\"border-top: 1px solid rgba(250,249,245,0.14); width: 100%;\"></div><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9a9997;\"><span>Internal Review Draft</span><span>September 2026</span></div></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-2",
      "layout": "statement",
      "content": "<div class=\"fmd-slide\" style=\"padding: 72px 96px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; text-align: center; background-color: #000000; color: #faf9f5; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; gap: 24px;\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #01c8f1;\">The Core Problem</div><h2 style=\"font-size: 44px; font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0; max-width: 820px; color: #faf9f5;\">Most new users never reach the moment the product actually earns its keep</h2><p style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.35; color: #9a9997; margin: 0; max-width: 560px;\">Activation drops off well before week two, long before value has a chance to land.</p></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-3",
      "layout": "content",
      "content": "<div class=\"fmd-slide\" style=\"padding: 64px 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; background-color: #0f0f0f; color: #faf9f5; font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9a9997;\">Activation Funnel</div><h2 style=\"font-size: 38px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0;\">Where signups <span style=\"color:#01c8f1\">drop off</span> today</h2></div><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-top: 12px;\"><div style=\"background: #181818; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px 14px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9a9997;\">Signed Up<br><span style=\"font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: #faf9f5;\">4,820</span><br>100% of cohort</div><div style=\"background: #181818; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px 14px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9a9997;\">Verified Email<br><span style=\"font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: #faf9f5;\">3,690</span><br>76.5% of cohort</div><div style=\"background: #181818; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px 14px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9a9997;\">Connected Data<br><span style=\"font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: #faf9f5;\">2,210</span><br>45.9% of cohort</div><div style=\"background: #181818; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px 14px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9a9997;\">First Report<br><span style=\"font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: #faf9f5;\">1,340</span><br>27.8% of cohort</div><div style=\"background: #181818; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px 14px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #01c8f1;\">Still Active D30<br><span style=\"font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: #faf9f5;\">612</span><br>12.7% of cohort</div></div><p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: #9a9997; margin: 8px 0 0; max-width: 700px;\">Every stage bleeds users, but the drop from verified email to connected data is the steepest single step in the funnel.</p></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-4",
      "layout": "content",
      "content": "<div class=\"fmd-slide\" style=\"padding: 64px 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; background-color: #0a0a0a; color: #faf9f5; font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9a9997;\">Roadmap Detail</div><h2 style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0;\">Workstreams carried into <span style=\"color:#01c8f1\">Q4</span></h2></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; width: 100%;\"><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(250,249,245,0.16); font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9a9997;\"><div>Workstream</div><div>Owner</div><div>Status</div><div>Target</div></div><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(250,249,245,0.08); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.3;\"><div>Guided setup checklist</div><div style=\"color: #9a9997;\">Priya N.</div><div style=\"color: #01c8f1;\">In progress</div><div style=\"color: #9a9997;\">Oct 12</div></div><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(250,249,245,0.08); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.3;\"><div>Sample data on signup</div><div style=\"color: #9a9997;\">Marcus T.</div><div style=\"color: #9a9997;\">Not started</div><div style=\"color: #9a9997;\">Oct 26</div></div><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(250,249,245,0.08); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.3;\"><div>Inline product tour</div><div style=\"color: #9a9997;\">Priya N.</div><div style=\"color: #9a9997;\">Not started</div><div style=\"color: #9a9997;\">Nov 2</div></div><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(250,249,245,0.08); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.3;\"><div>Slack alert on first report</div><div style=\"color: #9a9997;\">Dana K.</div><div style=\"color: #01c8f1;\">In progress</div><div style=\"color: #9a9997;\">Nov 9</div></div><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(250,249,245,0.08); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.3;\"><div>Connector retry queue</div><div style=\"color: #9a9997;\">Marcus T.</div><div style=\"color: #9a9997;\">Blocked</div><div style=\"color: #9a9997;\">Nov 16</div></div><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.3;\"><div>Weekly digest email</div><div style=\"color: #9a9997;\">Dana K.</div><div style=\"color: #9a9997;\">Not started</div><div style=\"color: #9a9997;\">Nov 30</div></div></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-5",
      "layout": "two-column",
      "content": "<div class=\"fmd-slide\" style=\"padding: 64px 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: row; gap: 56px; background-color: #000000; color: #faf9f5; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; position: relative;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: 40px; right: 56px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 120px; font-weight: 600; color: rgba(250,249,245,0.05); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em;\">04</div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; flex: 1;\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9a9997;\">Why Now</div><h2 style=\"font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0;\">The onboarding rewrite pays for itself twice over</h2><p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #9a9997; margin: 0;\">Support tickets tagged setup confusion have grown faster than the account base for three straight quarters.</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #9a9997; margin: 0;\">Sales has started demoing the product manually to get around it, which does not scale past this quarter.</p><span style=\"display: inline-flex; width: fit-content; white-space: nowrap; background: rgba(1,200,241,0.12); color: #01c8f1; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 999px; margin-top: 8px;\">Highest leverage fix available</span></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; flex: 1;\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9a9997;\">What Changes</div><p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #faf9f5; margin: 0;\">New accounts land on a guided checklist instead of an empty workspace.</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #faf9f5; margin: 0;\">Sample data lets every user see a finished report before connecting anything real.</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #faf9f5; margin: 0;\">A single Slack alert replaces the four emails nobody was reading.</p></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-6",
      "layout": "content",
      "content": "<div class=\"fmd-slide\" style=\"padding: 64px 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; background-color: #0f0f0f; color: #faf9f5; font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9a9997;\">Customer Signal</div><h2 style=\"font-size: 40px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0; max-width: 760px;\">What we heard from <span style=\"color:#01c8f1\">eleven</span> churned accounts</h2><p style=\"font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.1; color: #faf9f5; margin: 0; max-width: 760px;\">I gave it twenty minutes on day one and never came back &mdash; nothing told me what to do next.</p><p style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 25.5px; color: #9a9997; margin: 0; max-width: 700px;\">That quote showed up, almost word for word, in four of the eleven exit interviews we ran this quarter.</p><p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.12; color: #9a9997; margin: 0; max-width: 700px;\">Nine of eleven never connected a live data source. Seven never invited a second teammate.</p></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-7",
      "layout": "content",
      "content": "<div class=\"fmd-slide\" style=\"padding: 64px 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px; background-color: #0f0f0f; color: #faf9f5; font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9a9997;\">Target Outcomes</div><h2 style=\"font-size: 37px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.03; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0;\">What success looks like by <span style=\"color:#01c8f1\">January</span></h2></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; gap: 48px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 42px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.05; color: #faf9f5;\">65%</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9a9997;\">D30 retention</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 42px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.05; color: #faf9f5;\">4.2 min</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9a9997;\">Time to first report</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 42px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.05; color: #01c8f1;\">-30%</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9a9997;\">Setup support tickets</div></div></div><div style=\"border-left: 3px solid #01c8f1; padding: 14px 20px; background: #181818; border-radius: 8px; max-width: 760px;\"><p style=\"font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.3; color: #faf9f5; margin: 0;\">None of this requires new headcount &mdash; it requires finishing what the last rewrite started.</p></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-8",
      "layout": "content",
      "notes": "Ask for the three decisions explicitly before moving to Q&A; do not let the meeting end without an owner on each.",
      "content": "<div class=\"fmd-slide\" style=\"padding: 64px 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; background-color: #000000; color: #faf9f5; font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9a9997;\">Next Steps</div><h2 style=\"font-size: 38px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0;\">Three decisions we need from <span style=\"color:#01c8f1\">this room</span></h2></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; max-width: 780px;\"><p style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55; color: #faf9f5; margin: 0;\">Approve the guided checklist as the new default landing experience for every signup, not just self-serve.</p><p style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55; color: #faf9f5; margin: 0;\">Give the onboarding rewrite one dedicated engineer through the end of Q4 instead of borrowed time.</p><p style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.15; color: #9a9997; margin: 0;\">Revisit the sample-data proposal once legal confirms what synthetic data we can ship inside the product.</p></div></div>"
    }
  ]
}
